# ── MARK LV — what never belongs in the repository ──────────────────────────
# Everything listed here is created by the app on first run. A fresh clone with
# none of it present boots straight to the setup screen, which is the intended
# first experience — so nothing here needs to be committed, and some of it must
# never be.

# ── Leftover editor/scratch files ────────────────────────────────────────────
*.bak
*_backup.py

# ── Session transcripts — never commit these ─────────────────────────────────
# A transcript captures tool output verbatim, and reading config/api_keys.json
# puts the live key into the transcript. One file, two credentials leaked.
session-*.md
.remember/

# ── Secrets. Committing any of these publishes them. ──────────────────────────
# The explanation goes on its own line: a trailing "# …" is part of the
# PATTERN in a .gitignore, so "config/api_keys.json   # your key" ignores
# nothing at all — and the key goes to the repository with everything else.
config/api_keys.json
config/certs/
config/whatsapp_web/
**/token*.json
**/client_secret*.json
*credentials*.json
.env
.env.*
# your Gemini API key, plus per-plugin credentials
dashboard/static/theologicus_generated.html
dashboard/static/vault_state.json
# the dashboard's TLS private key and certificate
# a LINKED WhatsApp session — committing it hands somebody your WhatsApp
# account, not just a key
# Google OAuth tokens (Gmail / Calendar plugins)
# Google OAuth client secrets

# ── Personal data the assistant accumulates about you ─────────────────────────
memory/long_term.json
memory/*.db
# a date: the mem0 plugin has already imported
memory/.mem0_imported

# ── Python build noise ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*$py.class
*.so
build/
dist/
*.egg-info/
.eggs/

# ── Virtual environments ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.venv/
venv/
env/
ENV/

# ── Editors and operating systems ─────────────────────────────────────────────
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini

# ── Runtime output ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
*.log
logs/
downloads/
screenshots/

dist/
build/
*.spec
*.log
__pycache__/
*.egg-info/
THEOLOGICUS-*.zip
